{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L3SMLy1Knp38HACNVs4byC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\\section{Conclusion}\n2\t\\label{sec:conclusion}\n3\t\n4\tWe have presented a systematic factorial diagnostic of temporal abstraction in DreamerV3, identifying the combination of trained $\\dt$-embedding and multi-rate data exposure as the causal factor behind conditioning-induced value overestimation (CIVO). The key findings are:\n5\t\n6\t\\begin{enumerate}[nosep,leftmargin=*]\n7\t\\item Every variable-rate imagination configuration degrades relative to the $\\dt{=}1$ baseline, with degradation scaling monotonically with $\\dt$.\n8\t\\item A normalized value-to-eval threshold of $\\nve \\geq 1.5\\times$ (35K+ window) achieves 7/8 CIVO classification ($n{=}8$, 87.5\\%), with the single false positive arising from a mechanistically distinct non-CIVO collapse. The combination of trained $\\dt$-embedding and multi-rate data exposure is the causal factor; unexposed, frozen, or removed embeddings prevent overestimation.\n9\t\\item The RSSM reward head develops a $2.78\\times$ prediction gap between $\\dt{=}1$ and $\\dt{=}2$ under trained conditioning, providing the systematic bias that drives critic overestimation.\n10\t\\item The same CIVO trigger produces stochastic downstream outcomes---full collapse, transient CIVO with self-correction, and oscillatory degradation---across seeds of identical configurations.\n11\t\\item Restricting imagination to $\\dt{=}1$ does not fully prevent collapse: one of two seeds fails via a qualitatively distinct non-CIVO pathway (eval-driven with increasing entropy), demonstrating that the trained $\\dt$-embedding creates vulnerability through multiple mechanisms.\n12\t\\end{enumerate}\n13\t\n14\tThe contrast with TAWM's success in MPC identifies the feedback architecture as the critical factor: $\\dt$-conditioning succeeds when errors are contained by re-planning from real states, but fails when errors compound through imagination-based actor-critic bootstrapping.\n15\t\n16\t\\paragraph{Limitations.}\n17\tOur experiments focus on a single environment (Walker Walk) and a single world-model architecture (DreamerV3/RSSM). While multi-seed replication establishes robustness within this setting, generalization to other environments and architectures---particularly transformer-based world models such as DreamerV4---remains an open question. The $\\nve$ threshold ($1.5\\times$, 35K+ window) is sensitive to value overestimation broadly but not perfectly specific to CIVO (7/8, one non-CIVO false positive; margin $0.62$ excluding the outlier); generalization to other tasks and architectures is pending validation.\n18\t\n19\t\\paragraph{Future directions.}\n20\tOur findings suggest three avenues. First, hierarchical temporal abstraction at the representation level---as in THICK and Hieros---may avoid the flat-conditioning failure mode by maintaining separate dynamics for each temporal scale. Second, gradient decomposition reveals that 93\\% of $\\dt$-embedding gradients originate from observation decoders, with 0\\% from the reward head---making reward-only gradient stopping (exp\\_016e) an architectural no-op. Full-pathway gradient stopping targeting observation decoders (exp\\_018) removes the dominant 93\\% contribution and completely eliminates CIVO (eval 915.7, NVE $1.00\\times$---indistinguishable from the healthy baseline), confirming that the vulnerability operates at the gradient level: observation reconstruction gradients are necessary for CIVO induction. Third, extending this diagnostic framework to transformer-based world models and continuous-control benchmarks would clarify whether CIVO is RSSM-specific or a broader vulnerability of temporal conditioning in imagination-based RL.\n21\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mibqf1WU3TJDQ7nWMwGzdf","session_id":"1b0edaaf-f3d3-4d02-90e4-a445b4dd87c2","uuid":"2a61b0df-859e-4596-a9d8-50f73c36b2bf","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:27:18.044Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SEYnQzaPSVZmHK2udH7QCs","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_010b_cheetah_civo_trigger | Cheetah Run CIVO trigger — trained dt_emb, subsample ON, dt=2, H=8, seed 1. 跨环境验证：Walker 上 008d 配置在 Cheetah 上是否同样触发 CIVO (NVE>1.5x)。若成立→回应 reviewer \\\\\\\"single environment\\\\\\\" concern。 | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_020_vanilla_dreamerv3_s2: Vanilla DreamerV3 (no dt_emb, no subsample) seed 2 — Pathway B 控制实验：验证 008e_v3 s2 的 eval-driven collapse 是否需要 trained dt_emb 作为必要条件。如果 vanilla s2 稳定 → C6 成立 (trained dt_emb 是 Pathway B 必要条件)。如果也崩溃 → Pathway B 是 DreamerV3 inherent fragility。（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- exp_019b_pickcube_civo_trigger: PickCube-v1 CIVO trigger — trained dt_emb, subsample ON, dt=2 imagination, H=8. 预期触发 CIVO（trained dt_emb → NVE>1.5x → collapse），验证 CIVO 在 manipulation 环境是否成立（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- exp_018v2_full_sgs_walker_s1: Full-SGS 修正版: trained dt_emb + subsample ON + dt=2 + H=8 + full_sgs=True (detach all non-KL gradients from dt_emb). 修复 018 配置错误（缺失 gate 参数）。如果 CIVO 被消除 (NVE<1.5×) → 确认 obs decoder gradient 是 CIVO root cause → C5 成立。（已分配 ? GPU:?，等待提交）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_019a_pickcube_baseline** (killed): PickCube-v1 baseline — dt=1, no dt_emb (dim=0), subsample OFF. ManiSkill3 manipulation 环境稳定基线，验证 CIVO 诊断在 manipulation 中的适用性\\\\n- **exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1** (killed): Full-SGS: detach all non-KL gradients from dt_emb (removes 93% obs decoder contribution). If CIVO persists → vulnerability is representation-level; if eliminated → obs decoder gradient is root cause. ← 基于 exp_016e_sgs_walker_s1\\\\n  [exp_018_full_sgs_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1/report/analysis_report.md)\\\\n- **exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1** (success): Cheetah Run baseline seed 1 — 建立第二环境 dt=1 参考基线，为跨环境验证 C1/C2 做准备（plan_020）\\\\n  [submit_plan020_cheetah_baseline](/api/workspace-files/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1/intermediate/submit_plan020_cheetah_baseline.sh)\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 9 / 负向 13 / 失败 6 / 共 42\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-45299: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_002_event_gated: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008a: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008c: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008d: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_fixed_dt1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008e_v2_subsample_on_dt1_h15: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009d_baseline_walker_s1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009f_008f_walker_s1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_017_subsample_off_trained_dt_emb: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009g_008f_walker_s0: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_009h_008f_walker_s0: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016b_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016c_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_016d_sgs_walker_s1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- 016e: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_019a_pickcube_baseline: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2935, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TcjRwnpoLXHM9pNf7QHJEG","session_id":"1b0edaaf-f3d3-4d02-90e4-a445b4dd87c2","uuid":"9fb8b2c6-5951-4b9e-9a05-19cbbfc222d3","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:27:18.019Z"}
