{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VLpsMC1W1RS9ct9aFuKBUY","type":"tool_result","content":"decisions.yaml:1307:  rationale: 018 (Full-SGS) 移除 obs decoder gradient pathway (93%) 后 CIVO 完全消除：eval\ndecisions.yaml:1350:    not None 守卫跳过。018 的 eval_return 与 baseline s1 浮点精度一致（11/11 checkpoints），NVE=1.00×\nROADMAP.md:36:| 018 Full-SGS | ✅ CIVO 是 gradient-level 现象 | NVE 1.00×, eval 915.7@105K |\ndocs/paper/sections/analysis.tex:76:Exp\\_018 provides the definitive test of the gradient decomposition hypothesis. Detaching all non-KL gradients from $e_{\\dt}$ (removing the dominant 92.7\\% observation decoder contribution) completely eliminates CIVO: evaluation reaches 915.7 at 105K steps with NVE $1.00\\times$---indistinguishable from the healthy baseline, fully reversing the pathological overestimation observed in exp\\_008d ($4.12\\times$) and exp\\_016e ($10.42\\times$).\ndocs/paper/sections/conclusion.tex:20:[Omitted long matching line]\ndocs/paper/sections/introduction.tex:6:[Omitted long matching line]\ndocs/paper/sections/results.tex:244:[Omitted long matching line]\ndocs/paper/sections/results.tex:249:\\item Exp\\_018 (full-pathway SGS, 92.7\\% removal): NVE $1.00\\times$, eval 915.7---CIVO completely eliminated.\ndocs/paper/sections/results.tex:253:Notably, exp\\_018 \\emph{outperforms} the no-embedding control (008f) by $1.82\\times$ in final evaluation (915.7 vs.\\ 503.0), demonstrating that the KL-only temporal signal provides useful dynamics information without inducing the pathological co-adaptation that drives CIVO. The observation decoder gradient pathway is necessary for CIVO induction; removing it eliminates the vulnerability within the 105K training horizon tested.\nartifacts/manifest.yaml:1725:  description: 'Analysis script for exp-018 Full-SGS: eval curves, NVE trajectories,\nartifacts/018_prewrite_two_versions.md:29:$H{=}8$), exp\\_018 reaches evaluation [EVAL] at 105K steps with peak NVE [NVE]$\\times$\nartifacts/018_prewrite_two_versions.md:59:018 & Full-SGS & trn$^\\ddagger$ & ON & 8 & [EVAL]@105K & [NVE]$\\times$ & Healthy \\\\\nartifacts/018_prewrite_two_versions.md:77:$d{=}32$, subsample ON, $H{=}8$), exp\\_018 still collapses: evaluation degrades to\nartifacts/018_prewrite_two_versions.md:114:018 & Full-SGS & trn$^\\ddagger$ & ON & 8 & [EVAL]@[STEP]K & [NVE]$\\times$ & CIVO collapse \\\\\nscripts/analyze_018_full_sgs.py:2:\"\"\"Exp-018 Full-SGS analysis: eval curves, NVE trajectories, CIVO verdict.\nscripts/analyze_018_full_sgs.py:8:  - 018_eval_comparison.{pdf,png}   — learning curves overlay\nscripts/analyze_018_full_sgs.py:195:        path = os.path.join(output_dir, f\"018_eval_comparison.{ext}\")\nscripts/analyze_018_full_sgs.py:198:    print(f\"Saved eval curves to {output_dir}/018_eval_comparison.{{pdf,png}}\")\nscripts/plot_018_results.py:1:\"\"\"Visualize exp_018 Full-SGS results vs controls — eval curves + NVE trajectories.\"\"\"\nscripts/plot_018_results.py:96:    out = os.path.join(OUTPUT_DIR, \"fig_018_eval_curves.pdf\")\nartifacts/narrative_audit.md:173:- \"Reward-pathway stop-gradient is empirically confirmed as a no-op (016e); gradient decomposition shows that observation decoders provide 93% of dt_emb's training signal. Full stop-gradient (018, detaching all non-KL gradients) targets the correct pathway and is pending evaluation.\"\nartifacts/_project/report/018_analysis_criteria.md:23:- **Peak comparison**: 018 peak_eval vs 008d peak_eval (167@25K) and baseline\nartifacts/_project/report/018_analysis_criteria.md:62:Outputs: `018_eval_comparison.{pdf,png}`, `018_nve_comparison.{pdf,png}`, `018_summary.json`\nartifacts/_project/report/narrative_audit.md:173:- \"Reward-pathway stop-gradient is empirically confirmed as a no-op (016e); gradient decomposition shows that observation decoders provide 93% of dt_emb's training signal. Full stop-gradient (018, detaching all non-KL gradients) targets the correct pathway and is pending evaluation.\"\nartifacts/_project/data/bootstrap_cis_summary.txt:1:008d NVE: mean=2.64 [1.71, 4.13] (n=3 checkpoints, 35K-55K)\\n018 NVE: 1.0 at all checkpoints (CIVO eliminated)\\nSeed variability (s1-s0) full: 183.8 [136.2, 234.0]\\nSeed variability last 10 checkpoints: 21.6 [11.5, 31.4]\\n010a Cheetah ve_ratio last10: 0.722 [0.705, 0.742]\\n010a Cheetah eval_return last10: 803.2 [779.0, 826.3]\nreport.md:17:- **exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1** (killed): Full-SGS: detach all non-KL gradients from dt_emb (removes 93% obs decoder contribution). If CIVO persists → vulnerability is representation-level; if eliminated → obs decoder gradient is root cause. ← 基于 exp_016e_sgs_walker_s1\ntask_context/history/reviewer/loop_12.md:34:- 018 完成（~105K steps, 3-4h after start）→ **核心审查**：Full-SGS 是否阻止 CIVO？NVE 轨迹、eval 曲线、dt_emb gradient 验证（应只剩 7% KL）。结果决定 paper 叙事走向\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T133210/logs/review_best.log:9:[Omitted long matching line]\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T133210/logs/review_best.log:28:[Omitted long matching line]\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T133210/logs/review_best.log:30:[Omitted long matching line]\n\n[Showing results with pagination = limit: 30]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mibqf1WU3TJDQ7nWMwGzdf","session_id":"1b0edaaf-f3d3-4d02-90e4-a445b4dd87c2","uuid":"15582c7a-2f25-4486-9b93-2abe9f725c07","timestamp":"2026-05-16T14:28:25.493Z"}
